Package: focusflow
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, xdotool, wmctrl
Description: Focus and productivity app with real app blocking
 FocusFlow is a local-first focus timer and distraction blocker.
 It combines focus sessions, task planning, schedules, application blocking,
 website blocking, allowances, notes, habits, and reports.